### Criar um gasto
POST http://localhost:8081/api/expenses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Supermercado",
  "amount": 150.90,
  "category": "Alimentação",
  "date": "2026-09-29"
}


### Listar gastos
GET http://localhost:8081/api/expenses


### Teste da IA
POST http://localhost:8081/api/ai/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Quanto eu gastei entre 01/09/2026 e 30/09/2026?"
}

### Criar segundo gasto
POST http://localhost:8081/api/expenses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Combustível",
  "amount": 100.00,
  "category": "Transporte",
  "date": "2026-08-15"
}

### Perguntar gastos de agosto
POST http://localhost:8081/api/ai/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Quanto eu gastei em agosto de 2026?"
}

### Teste completo: Audio → Whisper → Llama → Banco
### Teste completo: Audio → Whisper → Llama → Banco
# @timeout 120000
POST http://localhost:8081/api/ai/audio
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----SmartBudgetBoundary

------SmartBudgetBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="audio"; filename="audio.wav"
Content-Type: audio/wav

< C:\Users\gusto\audio.wav
------SmartBudgetBoundary--
POST http://localhost:8081/api/ai/audio
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----SmartBudgetBoundary

------SmartBudgetBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="audio"; filename="audio.wav"
Content-Type: audio/wav

< C:\Users\gusto\audio.wav
------SmartBudgetBoundary--

### Teste TTS
GET http://localhost:8081/api/ai/audio/test